@host = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@key = demo-key-1

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Create an application (applicant view).
### €3,000 over 12 months does not fit this budget, so the term is extended.
POST {{host}}/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "treatment": "dental",
  "treatment_cost_eur": 3000,
  "preferred_term_months": 12,
  "net_monthly_income_eur": 2550,
  "housing_costs_eur": 1000,
  "existing_obligations_eur": 200,
  "household": "single",
  "additional_context": "My work contract is temporary and ends in six months."
}

### Applicant view: replace ID
GET {{host}}/applications/REPLACE-WITH-ID

### Employee: full dossier (answers, decision basis, audit events)
GET {{host}}/applications/REPLACE-WITH-ID/dossier
X-API-Key: {{key}}

### Employee: verify the audit hash chain
GET {{host}}/applications/REPLACE-WITH-ID/audit/verify
X-API-Key: {{key}}

### Employee: override (employee id comes from the key, not the body)
POST {{host}}/applications/REPLACE-WITH-ID/override
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "outcome": "accepted",
  "reason": "Contract extension letter seen and verified."
}

### A decline (zero income): shows the decline message
POST {{host}}/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "treatment": "eye",
  "treatment_cost_eur": 25000,
  "preferred_term_months": 6,
  "net_monthly_income_eur": 0,
  "housing_costs_eur": 1000,
  "existing_obligations_eur": 200,
  "household": "single",
  "additional_context": ""
}